+config H713_SPL_RESCUE
+	bool "H713 recovery: FEL-loaded SPL boots U-Boot proper from eMMC"
+	depends on H713_SPL_FORCE_MMC
+	help
+	  Skip the sector-16 restore hook and continue into U-Boot proper,
+	  loaded from SYS_MMCSD_RAW_MODE_U_BOOT_SECTOR. Pointed at a spare
+	  copy of a known-good U-Boot proper, this brings up a prompt when
+	  the normal U-Boot proper slot no longer starts. Never enable this
+	  in a shipping image.
